{"id":"u46","kelas":12,"no":5,"judul":"Tata Bahasa untuk Ujian","title":"Grammar for Exams","emoji":"✍️","ringkas":"Pola soal tata bahasa dan kesalahan umum","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali pola soal tata bahasa: **complete the sentence**, **error recognition**, dan **rearrange**","menguasai **subject-verb agreement** dan pemilihan **tense**","membedakan **word class** (noun, verb, adjective, adverb) dan kata hubung","memakai **article**, **preposition**, **gerund/infinitive**, dan **comparison** dengan tepat","menghindari kesalahan umum seperti *he don't*, *more better*, dan *discuss about*","mengerjakan latihan campuran tata bahasa bergaya ujian"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Soal tata bahasa dalam ujian biasanya berpola: **melengkapi kalimat**, **menemukan kesalahan**, atau **menyusun kalimat**. Kamu tidak perlu menghafal semuanya. Cukup kuasai **pola dan kesalahan umum**, lalu periksa tiap pilihan dengan tenang."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Pola soal tata bahasa","table":[["Pola","Contoh","Cara mengerjakan"],["**Complete the sentence**","[[She ___ to school every day.]] (go / goes)","lihat subjek dan petunjuk waktu"],["**Error recognition**","[[He (A) don't (B) like (C) fish.]]","cek bagian yang berpotensi salah"],["**Rearrange**","[[always / she / early / wakes up]]","subjek + kata kerja + keterangan"],["**Choose the best answer**","[[If I ___ rich, I would travel.]]","kenali pola kalimat (conditional)"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Subject-verb agreement","table":[["Aturan","Contoh"],["Subjek tunggal + verb-s","[[She plays tennis.]] / [[The boy runs fast.]]"],["Subjek jamak + verb dasar","[[They play tennis.]] / [[The boys run fast.]]"],["**everyone / somebody / nobody** = tunggal","[[Everyone is ready.]]"],["**Neither/Either ... of** = tunggal","[[Neither of them was late.]]"],["Subjek dengan *of*: patokan kata pertama","[[A box of books is on the table.]]"],["**There is** + tunggal / **There are** + jamak","[[There is a pen.]] / [[There are two pens.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Memilih tense dari petunjuk waktu","table":[["Petunjuk","Tense"],["every day, usually, always","simple present"],["now, at the moment, look!","present continuous"],["yesterday, last week, ago, in 2010","simple past"],["while, when (sedang berlangsung)","past continuous"],["already, yet, ever, never, since, for","present perfect"],["tomorrow, next week, soon","will / be going to"],["By the time ..., before + lampau","past perfect"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Kesalahan umum","table":[["Salah","Benar","Alasan"],["He don't like fish.","[[He doesn't like fish.]]","he + doesn't"],["She can sings.","[[She can sing.]]","modal + kata kerja dasar"],["more better","[[better]]","better sudah comparative"],["discuss about the problem","[[discuss the problem]]","discuss tanpa about"],["I am agree.","[[I agree.]]","agree adalah kata kerja"],["He is more taller than me.","[[He is taller than me.]]","tall + er"],["I look forward to see you.","[[I look forward to seeing you.]]","to + V-ing"],["a information","[[a piece of information]]","information tak terhitung"],["many water","[[much water]]","water tak terhitung"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Kata yang sering tertukar","text":"[[much]] untuk tak terhitung, [[many]] untuk terhitung. [[few/a few]] untuk terhitung, [[little/a little]] untuk tak terhitung. [[since]] + titik waktu, [[for]] + durasi. [[affect]] (kata kerja) vs [[effect]] (kata benda)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Article, preposition, dan gerund/infinitive","table":[["Topik","Aturan","Contoh"],["**a / an**","benda tunggal pertama kali; an sebelum bunyi vokal","[[a book]] / [[an apple]] / [[an hour]]"],["**the**","benda tertentu / sudah disebut","[[The book on the desk is mine.]]"],["**Preposisi waktu**","at jam, on hari, in bulan/tahun","[[at 7]], [[on Monday]], [[in June]]"],["**enjoy / finish / avoid + V-ing**","gerund","[[I enjoy reading.]]"],["**want / hope / decide + to V1**","infinitive","[[I want to go.]]"],["**Comparison**","-er than / more ... than; the -est / the most","[[taller than]] / [[the most beautiful]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Word class dan kata hubung","table":[["Kelas kata","Contoh","Posisi"],["**Noun**","[[success]], [[beauty]]","setelah the, a, adjective"],["**Adjective**","[[successful]], [[beautiful]]","sebelum noun / setelah be"],["**Adverb**","[[successfully]], [[carefully]]","menerangkan kata kerja"],["**Kata hubung**","[[because]], [[although]], [[however]], [[so]]","menghubungkan klausa"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Membahas kesalahan","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Find the mistake: \"He don't like fish.\"","id":"Cari kesalahannya: \"He don't like fish.\""},{"who":"Dina","en":"It should be \"doesn't\", because the subject is 'he'.","id":"Seharusnya \"doesn't\", karena subjeknya 'he'."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. And \"She can sings\"?","id":"Bagus. Dan \"She can sings\"?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"After 'can' we use the base verb, so it is \"She can sing\".","id":"Setelah 'can' kita pakai kata kerja dasar, jadi \"She can sing\"."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara mengecek cepat","text":"Tanyakan 4 hal: 1) **Subjeknya tunggal atau jamak?** 2) **Petunjuk waktunya apa?** 3) **Setelah modal / to / preposisi, bentuk kata kerjanya?** 4) **Kata ini kata benda, sifat, atau keterangan?** Coret pilihan yang jelas salah, lalu bacakan kalimat dalam hati."},{"t":"summary","items":["Subjek tunggal + verb-s; jamak + kata kerja dasar; [[everyone]] = tunggal.","Pilih tense dari **petunjuk waktu**.","Modal + V1; [[to]] / preposisi + V-ing atau V1 sesuai pola.","Hindari kesalahan umum: [[doesn't]] bukan [[don't]] untuk he/she/it, [[more better]], [[discuss about]].","Cek kelas kata: noun, adjective, adverb."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kesalahan dengan perbaikannya:","pairs":[["He don't like fish.","He doesn't like fish."],["She can sings.","She can sing."],["more better","better"],["discuss about","discuss"]],"exp":"Kesalahan umum.","k":"81cf88de"},{"type":"match","q":"P