,"options":["I have an umbrella.","I have a umbrella.","I have the umbrella.","I have umbrella."],"answer":0,"exp":"an + vokal.","k":"8f6d90df"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["She is an honest girl.","She is a honest girl.","She is the honest girl.","She is honest girl."],"answer":0,"exp":"honest dibaca vokal.","k":"ac030810"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["He drives carefully.","He drives careful.","He drives care.","He drives carefulness."],"answer":0,"exp":"adverb.","k":"c557cc0a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["The weather is getting worse.","The weather is getting more bad.","The weather is getting badder.","The weather is getting worst."],"answer":0,"exp":"worse.","k":"26f8937f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang salah: \"She (A) can (B) plays (C) the piano (D).\"","options":["B","A","C","D"],"answer":0,"exp":"can plays → can play.","k":"0b6dd281"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang salah: \"There (A) is (B) three (C) books (D).\"","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":1,"exp":"three books → are.","k":"0074f9aa"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia tidak bisa berenang.\"","answer":"She cannot swim.","exp":"cannot + V1.","k":"36a16d9d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kuantitas dengan benda yang cocok:","pairs":[["much","water"],["many","books"],["a little","sugar"],["a few","friends"]],"exp":"much / a little untuk tak terhitung; many / a few untuk terhitung.","k":"f517d99c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"She is afraid of dogs","options":["Dia takut pada anjing","Dia suka anjing","Dia punya anjing","Dia membeli anjing"],"answer":0,"exp":"afraid of.","k":"5005e1f6"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"He apologised for being late","options":["Dia minta maaf karena terlambat","Dia datang tepat waktu","Dia marah","Dia pergi"],"answer":0,"exp":"apologise for.","k":"79e864b3"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["She doesn't like coffee.","She don't like coffee.","She not like coffee.","She doesn't likes coffee."],"answer":0,"exp":"doesn't + V1.","k":"0dcc0f89"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["He can swim well.","He can swims well.","He can swimming well.","He cans swim well."],"answer":0,"exp":"modal + V1.","k":"2064e318"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["She is better than me.","She is more better than me.","She is gooder than me.","She is best than me."],"answer":0,"exp":"better.","k":"9611c39a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["We discussed the problem.","We discussed about the problem.","We discussed of the problem.","We discussed on the problem."],"answer":0,"exp":"discuss tanpa about.","k":"ee67fc24"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I agree with you.","I am agree with you.","I agrees with you.","I am agreeing with you."],"answer":0,"exp":"agree = verb.","k":"66dc7277"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["Neither of them was late.","Neither of them were late.","Neither of them are late.","Neither of them be late."],"answer":0,"exp":"neither of = tunggal (baku).","k":"7a8ad26e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tinggal di sini sejak 2020.","q":"She has lived here ___ 2020.","answers":["since"],"hint":"sejak","exp":"since + titik waktu.","k":"acde8c0e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tidak ada banyak air di botol.","q":"There isn't ___ water in the bottle.","answers":["much"],"hint":"banyak","exp":"much + tak terhitung.","k":"81153251"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku suka bermain sepak bola.\"","answer":"I enjoy playing football.","exp":"enjoy + V-ing.","k":"641eb09b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan pola dengan contoh:","pairs":[["enjoy + V-ing","I enjoy reading."],["want + to V1","I want to read."],["modal + V1","I can read."],["since + waktu","since 2020"]],"exp":"Pola tata bahasa.","k":"6ff6d153"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"She has worked here since two thousand twenty","options":["Dia telah bekerja di sini sejak 2020","Dia bekerja di sini tahun 2020","Dia akan bekerja di sini","Dia pergi dari sini"],"answer":0,"exp":"since.","k":"8025b77e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa membaca ulang kalimat membantu?","options":["terdengar janggal jika salah","jadi lebih panjang","waktu bertambah","tidak ada gunanya"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kalimat salah sering terdengar janggal.","k":"bfaa8c86"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sudah makan.","q":"She has already ___. (eat)","answers":["eaten"],"hint":"V3","exp":"eaten.","k":"68159c65"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku tertarik pada musik.","q":"I am interested ___ music.","answers":["in"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"interested in.","k":"8924a454"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia pandai menggambar.","q":"She is good ___ drawing.","answers":["at"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"good at.","k":"98ca044a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["The children are playing in the yard.","The children is playing in the yard.","The children plays in the yard.","The children playing in the yard."],"answer":0,"exp":"children jamak.","k":"71ed1320"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I saw a movie yesterday.","I see a movie yesterday.","I have seen a movie yesterday.","I seeing a movie yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"yesterday → simple past.","k":"8c7109c4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["He is as tall as his father.","He is as taller as his father.","He is as tallest as his father.","He is as tall like his father."],"answer":0,"exp":"as ... as.","k":"a9cf5451"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["Because it rained, we stayed home.","Because it rained, so we stayed home.","Although it rained, so we stayed home.","Because of it rained, we stayed home."],"answer":0,"exp":"because tidak dengan so.","k":"368602f7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["He has been waiting for two hours.","He has been wait for two hours.","He is waited for two hours.","He have been waiting two hours."],"answer":0,"exp":"has been + V-ing.","k":"8b21a054"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia tidak pernah terlambat.\"","answer":"She is never late.","exp":"never setelah be.","k":"dea5e443"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan preposisi dengan kata:","pairs":[["afraid","of"],["good","at"],["interested","in"],["depend","on"]],"exp":"Kata + preposisi.","k":"8a3f33c4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"There are two books on the table","options":["Ada dua buku di atas meja","Ada satu buku","Buku itu hilang","Meja itu besar"],"answer":0,"exp":"there are.","k":"2ca1c84c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa langkah pertama saat melihat soal error recognition?","options":["memeriksa subjek dan kata kerja","memilih acak","melewati soal","menghitung huruf"],"answer":0,"exp":"Cek subjek dan kata kerja.","k":"0e87b9c9"}]}